    "title": "Heart to Heart",
    "enTitle": "Heart to Heart",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "ついに迎えた――模擬レース、当日。",
            "enText": "It was finally here――the day of the mock race.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 67,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（今日まで、緻密に調整を重ねてきた……）",
                    "enText": "(We fine-tuned the training each day……)",
                    "nextBlock": 2
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7848640946598966204,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "クラフトたちの最新データ……？\nすごいわね、ギリギリまで集めてくれていたのね。",
            "enText": "Kraft and the others' latest data……? That's amazing, \nyou've been gathering data all the way until the end.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 238,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "これを元に、君の作戦を練ろう",
                    "enText": "Let's base our new strategy on this",
                    "nextBlock": 3
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "これを元に、貴方の作戦を練ろう",
                    "enText": "Let's base our new strategy on this",
                    "nextBlock": 3
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 67,
                    "pathId": 4823394951192876836
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6658584542571581267,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "フフ、優秀なトレーナーがついてくれることが、\nこんなにも……心強いなんてね。",
            "enText": "Fufu, having a capable trainer on \nyour side……is really reassuring, isn't it?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 229,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 185,
                    "pathId": -1674775323119047640
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 34,
                    "pathId": 7915298241763757849
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 195,
                    "pathId": -5650745160847168507
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1726971572948329622,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "――私のmindを読んで、あなたが『言葉』にしてくれる。\n勝ちにいきましょう。私たち、ふたりで！",
            "enText": "――It's like you're reading my mind and putting \nit in to 『Words』. Let's win this. The two of us!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 285,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 6165554464166545027
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 57,
                    "pathId": 3206982032381114241
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 319,
                    "pathId": -2405119458797941812
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4900368087896906014,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "本番に向けて、仮のトレーナーとして緻密な調整を重ね、\nデアリングハートを見守ってきた。全ては――今日のために。",
            "enText": "I had been watching over Daring Heart as her provisional trainer, \nadjusting her training menu as needed. All for the sake of today.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 116,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 38,
                    "pathId": 2767782938025844382
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 45,
                    "pathId": -1533014472928628113
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 45,
                    "pathId": 4876912548374529926
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 158,
                    "pathId": -2573174488050227337
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 44,
                    "pathId": -5598741817027343333
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8362492737710296859,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "フフッ……鋭く、張り詰めて……\nまるで、あなたが走るみたいな顔ね？",
            "enText": "Fufuu…… So serious and tense…… \nIt almost looks like you're the one running today.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 285,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ごめん、緊張しちゃって……",
                    "enText": "Sorry, I'm just a little nervous……",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 34,
                    "pathId": -471925489893451758
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 112,
                    "pathId": -1244588682549292670
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 31,
                    "pathId": -6914158239024319398
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1463590097003693891,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "……フ。ねえ……私を誰だと思ってるの？",
            "enText": "……Heh. Hey……just who do you think I am?",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 236,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "え……？",
                    "enText": "Eh……?",
                    "nextBlock": 8
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 137,
                    "pathId": 8039135847992006625
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": 6598335657162470745
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3746459213839551397,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "不敵な笑みに、強張っていた心が熱く塗り替えられていく。",
            "enText": "That Daring smile was all it took to \ncompletely overwrite the anxiety I felt.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 80,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 229,
                    "pathId": 3376634432856447347
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7990134845795265230,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女は待っている。迷いを断ち切り、\n栄光の勝利を手にする、その名を呼ぶのを――",
            "enText": "She was waiting. Waiting for me to call out the name \nthat would cast aside all doubts to seize victory――",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 95,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（君は……）",
                    "enText": "(You are……)",
                    "nextBlock": 10
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "（貴方は……）",
                    "enText": "(You are……)",
                    "nextBlock": 10
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 296,
                    "pathId": -8251790445335558485
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1467895980579281942,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "――大胆になって。さあ……聞かせて？\nあなたが信じる、クイーンの名を。",
            "enText": "――Be Daring. Now……let me hear it. \nThe name of the Queen you believe in.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 263,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 187,
                    "pathId": -4972547213073069138
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1261609278273023379,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Go on, say it!",
            "enText": "Go on, say it!",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 79,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "見せつけよう――“Daring Heart”！",
                    "enText": "Show them your――\"Daring Heart\"!",
                    "nextBlock": 12
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 187,
                    "pathId": 1125232252101123044
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5905859525032615326,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Okay...!　行ってくるわ！\nMy Queendom……その第一歩を！",
            "enText": "Okay…! I'm heading out! \nMy Queendom……these are the first steps!",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 208,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 135,
                    "pathId": 1559917779805222550
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 71,
                    "pathId": 3684057356019031390
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1443231300097408293,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "よどみないスタートで、果敢に前へ出るデアリングハート。\nレースの主導権を握る、強気で冷静な走りだ。",
            "enText": "With a flawless start, Daring Heart surged forward. \nAiming to take control of the race, it was a calm, composed run.",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 108,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 132,
                    "pathId": -4841766474325714185
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -6891392617855527573
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 162,
                    "pathId": 8882559376196307179
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4439525540882293231,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "ハッ、ハッ、ハッ――",
            "enText": "Haa, haa, haa――",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 72,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 83,
                    "pathId": -8089517949565168035
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 162,
                    "pathId": 4825428451956724761
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 51,
                    "pathId": 8771408574529048504
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2545164998552762988,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ラインクラフト",
            "enName": "Rhein Kraft",
            "jpText": "はっ、はっ、はっ……！",
            "enText": "Haa, haa, haa……!",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 103,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 114,
                    "pathId": -6509644433250726671
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -3944413736193630090
