                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -6157443775882833749
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5804814655509426773,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "（……聞こえる。風の音、芝を蹴る音。\nライバルたちの息遣い――……ああ、まだよ。まだ焦らない）",
            "enText": "(……I can hear it. The sound of the wind rushing past, \nfeet kicking at the turf. The breath of my rivals――…… \nYeah, not yet. There's no reason to panic)",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 421,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 432,
                    "pathId": -6057908645509795207
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 25,
                    "pathId": -225786120269897633
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 464,
                    "pathId": -4339929803789215379
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5583341354373245372,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "（……理論が、私の感覚を裏付ける。あなたのくれたデータ通り、\nペースは私が支配している……）",
            "enText": "(……The theory aligns with my intuition. Just like the \ndata you gave me predicted, I am controlling the pace……)",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 329,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 432,
                    "pathId": 1651762923239601485
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 35,
                    "pathId": -6479782303069536336
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 168,
                    "pathId": 9145543370518064505
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3203246471960902191,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "（Stay calm……無駄な力はいらない。\nただ、その時を待つ――）",
            "enText": "(Stay calm……there's no need for excess power. \nJust wait for the right moment――)",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 226,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 432,
                    "pathId": 535256079099125169
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 464,
                    "pathId": -832272903358353334
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 8095755127276364230
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3722955037555594157,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "そしてレース終盤、それぞれが大きく動き出した――！",
            "enText": "And then as the race reached the \nfinal stages, everyone made their move――!",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 77,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 11,
                    "pathId": -6491729927123710263
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 52,
                    "pathId": 3961702539808402068
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 128,
                    "pathId": 5278870738386909951
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 136,
                    "pathId": -1567498854092510825
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1618551677417149719,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアメサイア",
            "enName": "Air Messiah",
            "jpText": "ここ――！　はああぁぁぁーーーーっ！",
            "enText": "Here――!! Haaaaaaaaaーーーー!",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 129,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 110,
                    "pathId": 5893516313303455481
