        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "初めて彼女の走りを追いかけた、あの日。\n何者も寄せ付けない鋭さで独走する姿を見て、途方もなさを感じた。",
            "enText": "That first day that I rode after her. With a sharpness \nthat made it hard to follow her, watching her continue \nto pull away, I was struck by her sheer determination.",
            "nextBlock": 45,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
