            "pathId": 1906860710699283916,
            "blockIdx": 44
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "あまりに遠くて果てしない。圧倒的すぎる。\nだからこそ――心が沸き立った。彼女の走りに、ひどく惹かれた。",
            "enText": "How far away she felt. How overwhelming. But that――is precisely \nwhy my Heart surged. I was completely captivated by her running.",
            "nextBlock": 46,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（また、置いていかれる――……！）",
                    "enText": "(She's leaving me behind again――……!)",
